      "text": {
        "jp": "ゾルダードが革命に成功したのは\r\nアメリアがいたから……。\r\n彼女はこの国の恩人なのです。",
        "official_en": "The Zoldaad revolution succeeded because of Amelia. Our nation owes everything to her.",
        "real_en": "The revolution in Zoldaad succeeded because of Amelia... She's a benefactor to this country."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
