        "official_en_sha256": "65609ee98626308259f52e8c787af6352393365e4907d4c0eea78d0b45e172ae"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "前に話したことですが、やはり間違いありません。\r\n彼らは手配書まで出して、彼女を追っているようです。",
        "official_en": "I fear what I said before is true—she is in trouble. Someone is pursuing her. They have even gone as far as to put a bounty on her.",
        "real_en": "What I told you before seems to have been right. They're even putting out wanted posters to hunt her down."
      },
